{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Your job is simple, well-paid, and pretty chill. You've got a full pack of smokes, a good buddy on speed dial, and your favorite playlist on cassette.</strong><br> <br>You've got a task: pack up the Kowalskis\u2019 belongings, clean the place, and do a few repairs. The house has to be ready for sale, so you\u2019ll need to make sure there are no skeletons in the closet \u2014 literally. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400650/extras/98a8674d13afb013f5e4275008e962e1.poster.avif?t=1762933941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400650/extras/98a8674d13afb013f5e4275008e962e1.webm?t=1762933941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The downsides? Sure, but nothing major...</strong><br>The previous family is missing. Strange weather phenomena are common in the area. You\u2019ll have to solve a series of grim puzzles left behind by the deranged dad \u2014 and follow a few weird rules to make sure nothing... interrupts your work.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400650/extras/238997f92bb6d3cb1354df339cbdd282.poster.avif?t=1762933941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400650/extras/238997f92bb6d3cb1354df339cbdd282.webm?t=1762933941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<br>Just press play and enter the world of dusty VHS horrors \u2014 inspired by an original <strong>creepypasta</strong> and built around the 'rules to follow' trope.    <br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handyman Work Simulator Immersive Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money-Earning Mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what d\u2019you say \u2014 takin\u2019 the gig?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survival Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/da9b0572cbe2dbaff0df4a0b04aa4088a3bc6028.jpg"},{"name":"Handyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/b86ec99f69a2bfe4a2ce8ba9456905c250480488.jpg"},{"name":"Geeky Geologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/a0d09156751409d25153edeaf3af65a2aeed3bd0.jpg"},{"name":"Geo Geek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/d0c569ee184921412ecc2a569658f323f03184b6.jpg"},{"name":"Helping Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/356a203d544a2828bd01babf8a1e49f30c96552d.jpg"},{"name":"Big Red Doors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/efc15973ffb85d11aaafd3acd121cf8d55fe6628.jpg"},{"name":"Window Repair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/05b64dfa5c9790d0e38d1b90ee464a67d8bfd18f.jpg"},{"name":"Spotless Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400650/bc93c6b277f74d15bce63eae258a3cc4fc777502.jpg"},{"name":"Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/340